  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Make sure color filters are off\n\n3. Enable face mirror\n\n4. See your face mirror work normally\n\n5. Go to settings and enable the Retro LUT color filter anywhere between 5 to 100%\n\n6. Close the settings menu\n\n7. See the black background behind your avatar.",
